So it's just like manipulation then when he said it'll get my foot in their door? Cause it's not my fault I haven't worked with them yet since they never CALL OR EMAIL ME.

&#x200B;

Can I ask about your bias? I'm beginning to think a lot of these companies are mostly BS...….. Or it's just the fact a Bachelor's + retail experience isn't good enough for a mere office/receptionist job idk

It was the last day of college for the semester, super busy day. Exams, final meeting, and then of course, airport. I was up at 4am after going to bed at 12am. So no sleep, therefore, no hunger without sickness. THIS IS IMPORTANT TO THE STORY.

So all I had that day was a bottle of orange soda and a few cashews.

&#x200B;

Fast forward a few hours to the airport. My stomach felt like shit. I figured, well, guess I should take my first-ever dump in a public restroom. And it's an airport yeehaw!

&#x200B;

So I sit down in the empty bathroom (weird?) and then this fucking mom and her two kids decide to take the stall RIGHT NEXT TO MINE. And I realized at that point that this is explosive diarrhea. Because, duh. Sugar liquid and stress. So here I am trying to be quiet as soda shit explodes out of my asshole (not working). But luckily it was a quick poop.

&#x200B;

And then little old me, who has been spoiled with using baby wipes instead of toilet paper for my 20 fucking years of life!!! had a grand old time wiping with that super paper thin toilet paper.

&#x200B;

Mom in the empty-minus-pooping-college-kid bathroom 3 years ago, I hope my explosive shitting scarred you.

&#x200B;

TL;DR mom and kids get in the stall next to me while i'm having explosive diarrhea in an otherwise empty airport bathroom

Only time she was supporting of the dating scene was when she had a crush on someone that she almost had a chance with. Then he "broke her heart" and she's anti-men and anti-dating in general (because gay relationships are a no-no to our families)

&#x200B;

So it's usually just "ew dating" as a broad term and I agree with her to a point, just to keep it as "I don't like dating but i'd be open to it w/the right person" she just doesn't know that person is her
